# Reporting view: daily token and cost lines with current-view export controls
Output tools/vhs/.render.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1500
Set Height 1100
Set Padding 20

Hide
Type "sh tools/vhs/.demo/run.sh"
Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "3"
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 2s
Screenshot assets/reporting.png
Sleep 1s
